{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "107", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That ends a highly anticipated T20I series in a very sorry manner. It was Pakistan supposed to give a TOUGH FIGHT to the Windies but in reality, they drubbed the Caribbeans. The biggest point to come out of this T20I series has been West Indies' inability to play spin and the home side will look to exploit more of that in the 3-ODI series beginning on Friday, 30th September, 2016 at 1630 IST (1100 GMT) in Sharjah. Do join us then. Adios! Take Care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "106", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Victorious Pakistan captain SARFRAZ AHMED thanks the Almighty and is visibly happy with Pakistan's first ever 3-0 whitewash. Praises his team for playing so well in this heat and also the coaching and training staff. Admits that the goal was not to lose focus tonight, in spite of having already won the series and praises all his bowlers for restricting a good team on a good pitch to a moderate total. On his captaincy, he says that he has always looked to keep things simple and not make them complicated. Is confident that from the 5th ODI in England, Pakistan have been on a roll and can win the ODI series here as well.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "105", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "West Indian skipper CARLOS BRATHWAITE admits that there are a few young guys in the team. In all the three games, they could not step up with the bat, he says and feels Pakistan were the deserved winners. He agrees that the opposition had better skill and hopes that the performance would be better in the ODIs. Wants to review his own performance as a skipper and looks to learn from his experiences.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "104", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match and Series, IMAD WASIM says that he works hard and believes in the Almighty and luckily he has been able to get results. (On whether he is enjoying this purple patch) Laughs and says that he wouldn't call it a purple patch. Looks to bowl on the batsmen's pads, based on their footwork. (On his batting) He takes pride in his batting and has worked hard on it. He says that God willing, others will see it as well. Ends by thanking the crowd for their support and encouragement.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "103", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Kesrick Williams changed the script slightly tonight, finishing with figures of 4-0-15-2 but that did not have much impact on the home side as Azam and Malik took Pakistan home without much difficulty. A forgetful series for the Caribbeans and they will hope for a better show in the ODIs and the Tests. Stay tuned for the presentation.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "102", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Another comfortable win for Pakistan. They sweep the series 3-0 and have done it comprehensively. Same old story tonight, the spinners stifling the visitors and then the batsmen gunning down a below-par total with consummate ease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "15.1", "Id": "101", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "SIX! CLEAN SWEEP! Shoaib finishes it in style! Full outside off, Malik takes a step forward planting his foot down and lofts that delivery gigantically over long on for a maximum. Handshakes all around and the players walk off the field. PAKISTAN WIN BY 8 WICKETS AND 29 BALLS TO SPARE AND WHITEWASH WEST INDIES 3-0.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.6", "Id": "100", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Stays back in his crease and blocks.", "Summary": {"Score": "102/2", "Over": "15", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "27", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2734", "Runs": "37", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "21", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.5", "Id": "99", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Driven through the covers by the batsman. Two runs added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.4", "Id": "98", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Outside off, punched through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.3", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "DROPPED! Short and outside off, Malik looks to force it through the off side but gets a bottom edge. It hits Fletcher onto his pads and rolls down to short third man. Azam is halfway down the track for the single but is sent back. The fielder has a shy at the bowler's end but misses. Malik now wants to run on the overthrow but Azam has backed up too far.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.2", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fuller ball outside off, pushed to the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.1", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "The batsman rocks onto the back foot and punches the ball. One run added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.6", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Fuller ball on the pads, worked down the leg side for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "97/2", "Over": "14", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "2734", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "35", "Balls": "30", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "24", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3556", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "31", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.5", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "FOUR! LOFTED! Full on off, Malik dances down the pitch and lofts it over mid off for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.4", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "FOUR! Clever batting! Malik comes down the track. It is a length delivery on the stumps and he adapts well to it, using the pace to work it fine down the leg side and it crosses the ropes at fine leg.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.3", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "BEATEN! Full ball outside off, a lack of pace and some inside swing and Malik fails to put bat on ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.2", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Bravo changes it up with a yorker but Malik does well to dig it out.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Shorter ball outside off, Malik pulls it away through the leg side for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Loopy ball outside off, Malik lofts it but the ball is not able to clear mid-wicket. Malik keeps the strike with a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "86/2", "Over": "13", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "2734", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "24", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "24", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Served on off, driven off the front foot to the off side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Played to the point region by the batsman. They pick up a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Floated on off, Malik waits and plays it to point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Landed on the pads, flicked through square leg.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Floated outside off, defended off the back foot to cover for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fullish ball on middle and leg, tapped fine down the leg side for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "82/2", "Over": "12", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "22", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2734", "Runs": "22", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3556", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! Well played! Short delivery down the leg side, Babar waits for the ball to come at him. He pulls it late and the ball goes through fine leg for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Azam pushes it through the covers for a brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Shortish delivery on the stumps, pulled through square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Shorter ball outside off, Azam guides it to third man for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Short and around middle, pulled down to fine leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Full on leg, flicked to mid-wicket for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "72/2", "Over": "11", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "2734", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "20", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "14", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Pitched on off, the ball spins in sharply and strikes Malik low on the pads.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Flighted around off, pushed to the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Flighted outside off, spinning a bit, Malik waits for it and punches it from within the crease to the covers for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Served on middle and off, nudged through square leg for a brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Shorter ball around off, punched off the back foot to the off side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SUNIL NARINE is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "The batsman has pushed it to the cover region.", "Summary": {"Score": "65/2", "Over": "10", "Runs