ird man for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Full and outside off again, pushed towards point once more.", "Summary": {"Score": "61/2", "Over": "9", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "2734", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "16", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, eased through the covers for a brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "FOUR! A short ball around middle, Malik gets across and helps it through backward square leg for consecutive boundaries!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "2734", "Commentary": "FOUR! Full and outside off, Malik looks to go over the top but gets a thick inside edge which races past the stumps to the fine leg fence! 49 more needed from 69 balls now. Malik moves to 10 from 9 balls.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Def